      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd be happy to replace vowgan's 3rd person camera in my worlds just to get rid of the performance overhead in the first, but for that the native alternativity should be a worth replacements. Currently it just feels like a really simple prototype that is far from release ready. \n\nIt should definitely have more features, but most importantly have more reasonable keybinds, which F5 is definitely not the right choice, as way too many TVs etc make use of it, some other common F keys like F6 and F7 also already become very standard for volume controls.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
