      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I do very much have to agree, particularly about the zoom behavior. I'm very used to interacting with objects with the old default behavior, and in addition to this, I'm moving objects closer and further away from me MUCH more often than I am adjusting the third-person camera zoom. Whether as an option or whatever else, I'd much prefer to hold alt to zoom the third-person camera, and have the object interaction behavior remain consistent with how it is on the live client",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
